  "worked_solution": "The negation is represented by the symbol \"$\u00ac$\".\n\nThe sentence\n\n$10$ is **not** a prime number \n\ncan be expressed symbolically as $\u00acP.$ \n\nThe sentence\n\n$0.1$ is a real number \n\ncan be expressed symbolically as $Q.$\n\nTherefore, the sentence\n\n$10$ is **not** a prime number, and $0.1$ is a real number\n\ncan be expressed symbolically as $\u00acP\u2227Q.$",
